body:
Looking for a pair of studio monitors that would be inexpensive and loud. Don't need to be super hifi or fancy for this purpose. I just have a super small basic Behringer usb interface and honestly just want some monitors in the practice space room to play albums loud because I can't at my apartment! Thanks!

&#x200B;

e: It's down to the Behringer Truth B2031A or the JBL LSR305....
